    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 25A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella, theMinister of Higher Education and Highways, having obtained a report under Section 70C of the aforesaid Act, in respectof the Horizon College of Business and Technology (Pvt) Ltd, a company incorporated in Sri Lanka under the CompaniesAct, No. 7 of 2007 and bearing registration number PV 62877, do by this Order, amend the Schedule to the Order madeunder said Act, and published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 1975/47 of July 14, 2016 by the addition immediately afterthe entry \u2018\u2018Bachelor of Science Honours in Information Technology\u2019\u2019 appearing in Column I and it\u2019s corresponding entryin Column II thereof, of the entries specified under Column I and Column II respectively of the Schedule II hereto,subject to the conditions specified in Schedule I hereto :-",
